sequenceDiagram
    participant MobileApp
    participant Backend as Backend API
    participant RewardEngine as Reward Calculator
    participant SmartContract as Smart Contract<br/>(Blockchain)
    participant Blockchain as Blockchain Network
    participant PointsDB as Points Ledger DB

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
    Note over MobileApp,PointsDB: Phase 1: Trip Submission & Classification
    
    MobileApp->>Backend: POST /trips/submit<br/>{tripId, mode, distance, duration}
    Backend->>Backend: Classify transport mode<br/>(ML Service)
    Backend->>RewardEngine: calculatePoints(trip)
    
    RewardEngine->>RewardEngine: Formula: points = α × distance + β × duration<br/>Using DEIRA 2024 emission factors
    RewardEngine-->>Backend: {points, emissions_saved}
    
    Backend->>SmartContract: recordTrip(userId, tripData, points)
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Validate trip data<br/>Check fraud flags
    SmartContract->>Blockchain: Store trip record
    Blockchain-->>SmartContract: txHash, blockNumber
    
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Update user points balance<br/>points[userId] += calculated_points
    SmartContract->>Blockchain: Commit state change
    Blockchain-->>SmartContract: Confirmed
    
    SmartContract-->>Backend: {success, txHash, newBalance}
    Backend->>PointsDB: INSERT trip record<br/>(for quick queries)
    Backend-->>MobileApp: {tripId, pointsEarned, totalPoints}
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over MobileApp,PointsDB: Phase 2: Points Query & Verification
    
    MobileApp->>Backend: GET /points/balance
    Backend->>SmartContract: getBalance(userId)
    SmartContract->>Blockchain: Query state
    Blockchain-->>SmartContract: points[userId]
    SmartContract-->>Backend: {balance, lastUpdated}
    Backend-->>MobileApp: {totalPoints, tier}
    
    MobileApp->>Backend: GET /trips/history
    Backend->>PointsDB: SELECT * FROM trips<br/>WHERE userId = ?
    PointsDB-->>Backend: Trip records
    Backend->>SmartContract: verifyTrips(tripHashes[])
    SmartContract->>Blockchain: Verify on-chain records
    Blockchain-->>SmartContract: Verification results
    SmartContract-->>Backend: {verified: true}
    Backend-->>MobileApp: {trips[], verified}
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 235)
    Note over MobileApp,PointsDB: Phase 3: Reward Redemption
    
    MobileApp->>Backend: POST /rewards/redeem<br/>{rewardId, pointsCost}
    Backend->>SmartContract: redeemReward(userId, rewardId, points)
    
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Check balance<br/>require(points[userId] >= cost)
    
    alt Sufficient Balance
        SmartContract->>SmartContract: Deduct points<br/>points[userId] -= cost
        SmartContract->>SmartContract: Record redemption<br/>redemptions[userId].push(rewardId)
        SmartContract->>Blockchain: Commit transaction
        Blockchain-->>SmartContract: txHash
        SmartContract-->>Backend: {success, txHash, newBalance}
        Backend->>PointsDB: INSERT redemption record
        Backend-->>MobileApp: {success, reward details}
    else Insufficient Balance
        SmartContract-->>Backend: {error: "Insufficient points"}
        Backend-->>MobileApp: {error: "Not enough points"}
    end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 235, 245)
    Note over SmartContract,Blockchain: Smart Contract Key Functions
    Note over SmartContract: • recordTrip(userId, tripData, points)<br/>• getBalance(userId) → uint256<br/>• verifyTrips(hashes[]) → bool<br/>• redeemReward(userId, rewardId, cost)<br/>• getTripHistory(userId) → Trip[]<br/>• calculateTier(points) → string<br/>• emitRewardEvent(userId, points)
    end

    rect rgb(245, 240, 255)
    Note over Blockchain: Blockchain Stored Data
    Note over Blockchain: • User points balances (mapping)<br/>• Trip records (struct array)<br/>• Redemption history (struct array)<br/>• Emission factors (constants)<br/>• Reward catalog (mapping)<br/>• User tiers (calculated)
    end